lt from an empty environment, as the sibling tests in `test/harness/env-origin.test.ts` already do.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n   test('realpaths the workspace (through a symlink) and records the selection', async () => {\n@@\n-    const built = await buildManifest({\n+    const built = await runWithCqEnv(readCqEnv({}), () => buildManifest({\n       workspace: join(dir, 'link'),\n       sandbox: 'read-only',\n       toolPolicy: { allow: ['read'] },\n       harness: defaultHarnessConfig,\n       envNames: ['GH_TOKEN'],\n-    });\n+    }));\n```\n\n</details>\n\nAdd the `readCqEnv` import from `src/config/env.js` and the `runWithCqEnv` import from `src/config/run-env.js` to the test file.","id":"08fdbdc226ff2db137926153b4f9c34ae1022a3d697d8d78770c0df3ffb12df0","intervals":[[202,217]],"path":"test/harness/surface.test.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Pin the snapshot in `buildManifest` test so ambient `CQRUNENVPASSTHROUGH` cannot change `envNames`."}],"head":"d3a5769f4fece0bbe0e7699ff52974fffb0be6b5","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"c3f4bb82ace0d2b88f3df8d3df480ef670841db1","intervals":[[1,396]],"path":"test/harness/git-closed-forms.test.ts"},{"blob":"2bb41b9b6eb4ad3f64aa7c8a81fecc68d518db9d","intervals":[[1,345]],"path":"test/harness/mcp-bin.test.ts"},{"blob":"4987b15b33f854fed5c8dcfac4ae59e1777b8cdb","intervals":[[1,609]],"path":"test/harness/mcp-server.test.ts"},{"blob":"6d74518f523d7a2fb30f7f0be0e15c4196713fc6","intervals":[[1,234]],"path":"test/harness/run.test.ts"},{"blob":"7f10404335333da6c16adc1f15151c45d8c9e2c2","intervals":[[1,707]],"path":"test/harness/surface.test.ts"}],"job_id":"8d0194d370146ffc431ee482ee389126aaa6f62f24ecaae60112b98beaf73110:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"c3f4bb82ace0d2b88f3df8d3df480ef670841db1","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"test/harnes